---
config:
  theme: redux-color
  look: classic
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Клиент
    participant G as API Gateway
    participant B as build-service
    participant Cat as catalog-service
    participant Comp as compatibility-service
    participant K as Kafka

    C->>G: POST /api/v1/builds
    G->>B: POST /api/v1/builds (JWT)
    B->>Cat: GET /internal/v1/components/{id}
    Cat-->>B: 200 OK { component }

    Note over B,Comp: Попытка вызова с ретраями
    B->>Comp: POST /internal/v1/check (attempt 1)
    B->>Comp: POST /internal/v1/check (attempt 2)
    B->>Comp: POST /internal/v1/check (attempt 3)
    Note over B: Circuit Breaker OPEN

    B--)K: compatibility.failed
    B-->>G: 202 Accepted { buildId, status: DRAFT }
    G-->>C: 202 Accepted "Проверка будет выполнена позже"

    Note over Comp: Сервис восстановлен
    Comp--)K: compatibility.checked
    K--)B: compatibility.checked
    B-->>G: обновление статуса сборки
    G-->>C: SSE "Проверка завершена: SAVED / INCOMPATIBLE"